Welcome to the 2DGame in C. A learning experince for an unexpereinced dev

Here are notes for myself for how to setup the game. 

1) launch mysys ucrt64 
2) cd into the game folder
3) compile the game using a call like -- gcc src/main.c src/player.c -o game.exe $(pkg-config --cflags --libs sdl2)
    - note: The compile call is gcc {each .c file with the exact location path} -o (output) {output name}
4) run the game by doing ./game.exe




where to find SDL2 libraries and information ofline.
1) finding the location
MSYS2 UCRT64 command to find the location:
$ pkg-config --cflags sdl2 
    - uses pkg-config to ask where the files are located

$ ls /ucrt64/include/SDL2 
    - shows all of the header files within there that you can use in #include and give you their information

2) searching for specfic headers

$ grep -rn "SDL_Event" /ucrt64/include/SDL2 | head -40
$ grep -rln "SDL_Events;" /ucrt64/include/SDL2

3) reading it 
$ less /ucrt64/include/SDL2/SDL_events.h
    * within less you can use the search box to query for the location you are looking for